# Cloud trees-lane entrypoint: the city models and nothing else. Do NOT add
# the cross-city `data_source` merge or import tree_info here — with the
# merge in scope, pytrilogy plans a city's parquet from sources other than
# its own partition union (Athens shipped OSM-only that way), silently.
# Upstream report: pytrilogy issue on merged partition enums breaking
# completeness proofs. New cities must be imported here AND in
# tree_info.preql; full_tree_info itself is built by the enrichment lane.

